 "facts": [
  "LE Gen Y hierarchy: available for tlsserver/shortlived profiles 2026-01-07; default classic profile switched 2026-05-13. Roots YE/YR cross-signed by X1/X2; YE/YR not yet in Mozilla root program, so Debian 13 / Ubuntu 26.04 / Fedora 44 fail with 'unable to get local issuer certificate' if the server does not send the cross-signed root; fix: serve the full chain including the cross-sign.",
  "LE client auth EKU: classic profile stopped including it 2026-02-11; tlsclient profile ended May 2026; none after 2026-07-08 (search result). Breaks mTLS/XMPP s2s that used LE certs as client certs.",
  "LE lifetimes: 45-day opt-in on tlsserver from 2026-05-13; default 64 days in 2027; 45 days in 2028. Expiration emails ended (2025). IP address certs GA 2026-01-07 via shortlived profile.",
  "LE rate limits: 50 new certs per registered domain per 7 days; 5 per exact set of identifiers per 7 days (no overrides); 5 authorization failures per identifier per account per hour; 300 new orders per account per 3 hours; ARI renewals exempt. Error: 'too many ... in the last ..., retry after TIMESTAMP'.",
  "LE validation timeout case (NZ, 2025): PMTUD failure; workaround MTU 1280 / DNS-01; error 'Timeout after connect (your server may be slow or overloaded)'.",
  "Docker 28: unpublished container ports blocked from direct routing; 28.3.3 fixed CVE-2025-54388 (firewalld reload exposed loopback-published ports). Docker 29: experimental nftables backend (firewall-backend: nftables) creating ip docker-bridges tables.",
  "Tailscale on Linux: best with systemd-resolved stub mode (/etc/resolv.conf -> stub-resolv.conf); otherwise it overwrites resolv.conf and proxies DNS via 100.100.100.100; AL2023 loop issue #7816.",
  "Headscale behind proxy: WebSocket upgrade with Upgrade: tailscale-control-protocol over POST; Cloudflare proxy/tunnel unsupported; STUN UDP 3478 must be public for embedded DERP; gRPC not proxied; set server_url and trusted_proxies.",
  "NetBird: netbird status -d shows P2P vs Relayed, ICE candidate types; netbird debug bundle; routing peer needs ip_forward=1 and ACL rules.",
  "OPNsense NAT reflection: Firewall > Settings > Advanced reflection for port forwards; or split DNS instead.",
  "systemd-networkd-wait-online: 'A start job is running for Wait for Network to be Configured' ~120 s; fix optional: true on unused interfaces or --any."
 ]
}